{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854090/extras/b28020e057927e0b118a99319d7907e2.avif?t=1768154058\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854090/extras_big/b28020e057927e0b118a99319d7907e2.avif?t=1768154058 width=800 height=337 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Woke Gamer</strong> \u2013 a gaming news site that focuses on pushing DEI agenda under the guise of news, previews and reviews. You play as Mark, a new diversity hire, tasked to write articles for the site. But what kind of articles you choose to write for the publication determines your career in the industry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Based or Woke:</strong> You decide what kind of articles you want to write. Whether you want to represent the ideology of game websites or the best interest of gamers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use your power wisely:</strong> Call out gamers for their misogyny, homophobia and bigotry. Or, side with them and call out the forced DEI initiatives in the industry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your choices matter:</strong> Every choice you are going to make in the game will be remembered by other characters. Choose your options carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability</strong>: If you are not happy with your first run, try playing it again and make different decisions. Who knows what you might discover?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible by everyone:</strong> This game does not have a hard mode so even gaming journalists can play it.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3854090?t=1768154058","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3854090?t=1768154058","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854090/a95db72b29d97373e19b8b297b5b6dee9a282b23/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768154058","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854090/a95db72b29d97373e19b8b297b5b6dee9a282b23/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768154058","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854090/extras/b28020e057927e0b118a99319d7907e2.avif?t=1768154058\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854090/extras_big/b28020e057927e0b118a99319d7907e2.avif?t=1768154058 width=800 height=337 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Woke Gamer</strong> \u2013 a gaming news site that focuses on pushing DEI agenda under the guise of news, previews and reviews. You play as Mark, a new diversity hire, tasked to write articles for the site. But what kind of articles you choose to write for the publication determines your career in the industry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Based or Woke:</strong> You decide what kind of articles you want to write. Whether you want to represent the ideology of game websites or the best interest of gamers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use your power wisely:</strong> Call out gamers for their misogyny, homophobia and bigotry. Or, side with them and call out the forced DEI initiatives in the industry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your choices matter:</strong> Every choice you are going to make in the game will be remembered by other characters. Choose your options carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability</strong>: If you are not happy with your first run, try playing it again and make different decisions. Who knows what you might discover?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible by everyone:</strong> This game does not have a hard mode so even gaming journalists can play it.</p>","developers":["Suneil Angel"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854090/2308911e15c4b73aa755b99fbde6498d36aabbce/header.jpg?t=1768154058","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3854090/2025974493/a9db3d681f345729e56ff1e1bb782c2f906c7219/1764182369/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768154057","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3854090/2025974493/a9db3d681f345729e56ff1e1bb782c2f906c7219/1764182369/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768154057","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3854090/2025974493/a9db3d681f345729e56ff1e1bb782c2f906c7219/1764182369/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1768154057","id":257238890,"name":"Gaming Journo Simulator - Gameplay Overview","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257238890/b3027a96e0ac2f36d81c64c03fc2e5f0021024ae/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1768154057"}],"name":"Gaming Journo Simulator","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64Bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:<